  "releases_comment": "A diffusion release is a directory of files rather than one checkpoint, so it is fetched whole and used in place \u2014 the port's `NFKMLXSDReleaseFiles(directoryURL:)` reads the released tree directly, and no conversion step applies. `text_encoder` and `vae` files a release publishes in half precision load through `NFKMLXWeightPrecision.float32`, which is the precision the parity records were measured at.",
